ght enough to sip between bites.", "recipeCategory": "Mocktail", "recipeCuisine": "American", "keywords": "mushroom mocktail, alcohol-free, Watermelon", "recipeYield": "1 drink", "totalTime": "PT2M", "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Happie Fungi Fusion"}, "recipeIngredient": ["6 fresh mint leaves", "1/2 oz fresh lime juice", "Ice", "1 can Watermelon Fungi Fusion, chilled", "Lime wheel and a mint sprig"], "recipeInstructions": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Gently press the mint leaves with the lime juice in the bottom of a tall glass."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Fill with ice, top with Watermelon and stir once."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Garnish with the lime wheel and mint sprig."}]}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 7, "item": {"@type": "Recipe", "name": "The Zero-Proof Mango Mimosa", "url": "https://happiefusion.com/pages/recipes#zero-proof-mango-mimosa", "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/4946/6177/files/zero-proof-mango-mimosa-mocktail.png", "description": "The easiest drink on the list. Fungi Fusion Mango Mimosa was made for this.", "recipeCategory": "Mocktail", "recipeCuisine": "American", "keywords": "mushroom mocktail, alcohol-free, Mango Mimosa", "recipeYield": "1 drink", "totalTime": "PT1M", "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Happie Fungi Fusion"}, "recipeIngredient": ["2 oz chilled orange juice", "About half a can Mango Mimosa Fungi Fusion, well chilled", "Orange twist"], "recipeInstructions": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Pour the orange juice into a champagne flute."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Tilt the glass and slowly top with Mango Mimosa."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Twist the orange peel over the glass and drop it in."}]}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 8, "item": {"@type": "Recipe", "name": "Blue Raspberry Holiday Punch", "url": "https://happiefusion.com/pages/recipes#blue-raspberry-blueberry-holiday-punch", "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/4946/6177/files/blue-raspberry-holiday-punch.png", "description": "A big-batch punch so you're not playing bartender all night.", "recipeCategory": "Mocktail", "recipeCuisine": "American", "keywords": "mushroom mocktail, alcohol-free, Blue Raspberry", "recipeYield": "8", "totalTime": "PT5M", "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Happie Fungi Fusion"}, "recipeIngredient": ["4 cans Blue Raspberry Fungi Fusion, chilled", "2 cups white cranberry juice, chilled", "1/4 cup fresh lemon juice", "1 cup frozen blueberries", "3 or 4 rosemary sprigs", "Lemon slices"], "recipeInstructions": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Stir the white cranberry juice and lemon juice together in a punch bowl or large pitcher."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Add the frozen blueberries, rosemary and lemon slices."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Right before guests arrive, slowly pour in the Blue Raspberry so it stays fizzy. Serve over ice."}]}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 9, "item": {"@type": "Recipe", "name": "Watermelon Cranberry Rosemary Sparkler", "url": "https://happiefusion.com/pages/recipes#watermelon-cranberry-rosemary-sparkler", "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/4946/6177/files/watermelon-cranberry-rosemary-sparkler.png", "description": "Red, green and very holiday. Looks fancy, takes two minutes.", "recipeCategory": "Mocktail", "recipeCuisine": "American", "keywords": "mushroom mocktail, alcohol-free, Watermelon", "recipeYield": "1 drink", "totalTime": "PT2M", "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Happie Fungi Fusion"}, "recipeIngredient": ["2 oz unsweetened cranberry juice", "1/4 oz honey or simple syrup (optional)", "Ice", "About half a can Watermelon Fungi Fusion, chilled", "Rosemary sprig and a few fresh cranberries"], "recipeInstructions": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Stir the cranberry juice and honey together in a wine glass until the honey dissolves."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Add ice and top with Watermelon."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Garnish with the rosemary sprig and cranberries."}]}}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 10, "item": {"@type": "Recipe", "name": "Mango Ginger Mule", "url": "https://happiefusion.com/pages/recipes#mango-ginger-mule", "image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/4946/6177/files/mango-ginger-mule-mocktail.png", "description": "A holiday take on the classic mule, with ginger beer and tropical mango.", "recipeCategory": "Mocktail", "recipeCuisine": "American", "keywords": "mushroom mocktail, alcohol-free, Mango Mimosa", "recipeYield": "1 drink", "totalTime": "PT2M", "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Happie Fungi Fusion"}, "recipeIngredient": ["Crushed ice", "1/2 oz fresh lime juice", "2 oz non-alcoholic ginger beer", "About half a can Mango Mimosa Fungi Fusion, chilled", "Lime wedge and a slice of candied ginger"], "recipeInstructions": [{"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Fill a copper mug or rocks glass with crushed ice."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Add the lime juice and ginger beer, then top with Mango Mimosa."}, {"@type": "HowToStep", "text": "Stir gently and garnish. (Check the ginger beer label: a few brands sell an alcoholic version.)"}]}}]}</script>

<style>
.rc{--rc-ink:#16181B;--rc-green:#2D6A4F;--rc-blue:#2E3A9F;--rc-mango:#E07A10;--rc-melon:#2F8A57;--rc-cream:#FBF7EF;background:var(--rc-cream);color:var(--rc-ink);padding-bottom:80px;}
.rc-hero{position:relative;margin-top:calc(-1 * var(--nav-h,96px));min-height:clamp(520px,62vw,760px);display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:#EDE6D8;}
.rc-hero-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:70% 50%;}
.rc-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(251,247,239,.96) 0%,rgba(251,247,239,.86) 34%,rgba(251,247,239,0) 62%);}
.rc-hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:min(560px,40vw);padding:calc(var(--nav-h,96px) + 30px) 0 60px;margin-left:max(24px,6vw);}
.rc-eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--rc-green);margin:0 0 10px;}
.rc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4.6vw,62px);line-height:1.04;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 16px;}
.rc-sub{font-size:clamp(16px,1.4vw,18px);line-height:1.6;color:#3d4440;margin:0 0 26px;max-width:470px;}
.rc-hero-ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;}
.rc-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:52px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:50px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s,background .2s;}
.rc-btn--solid{background:var(--rc-green);color:#fff;}
.rc-btn--solid:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(45,106,79,.3);}
.rc-btn--ghost{border:2px solid var(--rc-green);color:var(--rc-green);background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);}
.rc-btn--ghost:hover{background:var(--rc-green);color:#fff;}
.rc-wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 22px 0;}
.rc-wrap h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,36px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0;}
.rc-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:26px;}
.rc-filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
.rc-chip{font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;padding:10px 16px;min-height:44px;border-radius:50px;border:1.5px solid rgba(22,24,27,.14);background:#fff;color:var(--rc-ink);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s;}
.rc-chip:hover{border-color:var(--rc-green);}
.rc-chip.is-on{background:var(--rc-ink);border-color:var(--rc-ink);color:#fff;}
.rc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;align-items:start;}
.rc-card{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.05);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);scroll-margin-top:110px;}
.rc-card[hidden]{display:none;}
.rc-img{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:#EFE8DA;overflow:hidden;}
.rc-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .5s ease;}
.rc-card:hover .rc-img img{transform:scale(1.03);}
.rc-tag{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:50px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);color:var(--rc-ink);}
.rc-body{padding:18px 20px 20px;}
.rc-flavor{display:inline-block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:50px;color:#fff;}
.rc-flavor--watermelon{background:var(--rc-melon);} .rc-flavor--mango{background:var(--rc-mango);} .rc-flavor--blue{background:var(--rc-blue);}
.rc-body h3{font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:900;margin:10px 0 6px;}
.rc-meta{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6a706c;margin:0 0 8px;}
.rc-meta span+span::before{content:'\00B7';margin-right:14px;}
.rc-blurb{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#4a514d;margin:0 0 12px;}
.rc-more summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--rc-green);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:44px;}
.rc-more summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
.rc-more summary::after{content:'+';font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1;}
.rc-more[open] summary::after{content:'\2212';}
.rc-more h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6a706c;margin:10px 0 6px;}
.rc-more ul,.rc-more ol{margin:0 0 6px;padding-left:20px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;}
.rc-more li{margin:3px 0;}
.rc-post{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--rc-green);}
.rc-tip{margin:28px auto 0;max-width:760px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;color:#4a514d;}
.rc-base-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px;}
.rc-base-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;background:#fff;border-radius:22px;padding:18px 18px 22px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);text-align:center;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;}
.rc-base-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
.rc-base-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain;border-radius:14px;}
.rc-base-name{font-weight:900;font-size:18px;margin-top:12px;}
.rc-base-price{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#6a706c;margin-top:2px;}
.rc-reads-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:22px;}
.rc-read{display:block;background:#fff;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;}
.rc-read:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.08);}
.rc-read img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;}
.rc-read-title{display:block;font-weight:900;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;padding:16px 20px 4px;}
.rc-read-link{display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--rc-green);padding:0 20px 20px;}
@media (max-width:980px){.rc-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
@media (max-width:1024px){
  .rc-hero{min-height:0;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;}
  .rc-hero::before{display:none;}
  .rc-hero-copy{max-width:none;margin:0;padding:calc(var(--nav-h,72px) + 22px) max(20px,5vw) 26px;background:var(--rc-cream);}
  .rc-hero-img{position:relative;inset:auto;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;}
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .rc-grid,.rc-base-grid,.rc-reads-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .rc-base-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;}
  .rc-base-card{padding:10px 8px 14px;border-radius:16px;}
  .rc-base-name{font-size:14px;} .rc-base-price{font-size:12px;}
  .rc-wrap{padding-top:48px;}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.rc-card:hover .rc-img img,.rc-btn:hover,.rc-base-card:hover,.rc-read:hover{transform:none;}}
</style>

<script>
(function(){
  var chips=document.querySelectorAll('.rc-chip'),cards=document.querySelectorAll('.rc-card');
  chips.forEach(function(c){c.addEventListener('click',function(){
    var f=c.getAttribute('data-filter');
    chips.forEach(function(x){var on=x===c;x.classList.toggle('is-on',on);x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',on?'true':'false');});
    cards.forEach(function(k){
      var show=f==='all'||(f==='batch'?k.hasAttribute('data-batch'):k.getAttribute('data-flavor')===f);
      k.hidden=!show;
    });
  });});
  // deep link (#recipe-id) opens that card's recipe
  var h=location.hash&&document.getElementById(location.hash.slice(1));
  if(h&&h.classList.contains('rc-card')){var d=h.querySelector('details');if(d)d.open=true;}
})();
</script>
